---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Topbar from '../components/Topbar.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us - Onlne File Share">
	<main class="page-shell">
		<Topbar />

		<section class="content-page">
			<p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
			<h1>Built for quick, simple file sharing.</h1>
			<div class="content-card">
				<p>Onlne File Share is a lightweight web tool for uploading a file, generating a download key, and sharing that key with someone who needs access. The goal is to keep file transfer simple, fast, and understandable.</p>
				<p>The product is designed for people who do not want a full cloud storage workspace just to send one file. Upload, copy the key or download link, share it through a trusted channel, and let the recipient retrieve the file from the browser.</p>
				<p>We focus on a clean interface, clear access-key behavior, mobile-friendly retrieval, and practical sharing tools such as QR codes and temporary download links.</p>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.content-page { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: min(900px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px 0; }
	h1 { margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 76px); line-height: 1; color: var(--ink); }
	.content-card { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--card-bg); box-shadow: var(--shadow); padding: 28px; }
	.content-card p { margin: 0 0 16px; color: var(--body); font-size: 17px; line-height: 29px; }
	.content-card p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
</style>
